<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= (typeof title !== 'undefined' && title) ? title : 'Citizen Data Rights Intake Portal | DPDP_Secure' %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        body {
            background: #0b0f19;
            color: #f3f4f6;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            margin: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .portal-card {
            background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.85);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 36px;
            max-width: 640px;
            width: 100%;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
            color: #60a5fa;
            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
        }
        p.subtitle {
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin: 0 0 24px 0;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }
        label {
            display: block;
            color: #d1d5db;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        input, select, textarea {
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 14px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.2s;
        }
        input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
            border-color: #3b82f6;
        }
        .otp-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .btn-otp {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 13px;
            cursor: pointer;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .btn-otp:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        }
        .btn-submit {
            width: 100%;
            background: #3b82f6;
            color: #ffffff;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .btn-submit:hover {
            background: #2563eb;
        }
        .statutory-notice {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 14px;
            margin-top: 24px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #93c5fd;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="portal-card">
        <div class="badge">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
            Section 11 & Section 12 Portal
        </div>
        <h1>Citizen Data Rights Portal</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Aarogya Diagnostic Center • Indiranagar, Bengaluru<br>Submit a statutory request regarding your personal diagnostic & health records.</p>

        <form action="/api/privacy/submit-dsr" method="POST">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label>Data Principal Full Name</label>
                <input type="text" name="principalName" placeholder="e.g. Deepa Nair" value="Deepa Nair" required>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label>Registered Mobile Number (with OTP Verification)</label>
                <div class="otp-row">
                    <input type="tel" id="principalPhone" name="principalPhone" placeholder="+91 9988776655" value="+91 9988776655" required>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-otp" onclick="document.getElementById('otp').value='882190'">Auto-Fill Test OTP</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label>Verification Code (SMS OTP)</label>
                <input type="text" id="otp" name="otp" placeholder="Enter 6-digit OTP (e.g. 882190)" value="882190" required>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label>Statutory Right Requested</label>
                <select name="requestType">
                    <option value="ERASURE" selected>Section 12: Right to Erasure of Personal Data</option>
                    <option value="ACCESS_SUMMARY">Section 11: Right to Access Summary of Personal Data</option>
                    <option value="CORRECTION">Section 12: Right to Correction & Updating</option>
                    <option value="GRIEVANCE">Section 13: Grievance Redressal / Complaint</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label>Reason / Specific Categories (Optional)</label>
                <textarea name="remarks" rows="3" placeholder="Specify if you wish to erase WhatsApp appointment records or test history...">Requesting complete deletion of WhatsApp chat history and contact leads after diagnostic test completion.</textarea>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">Submit Statutory Data Rights Request</button>
        </form>

        <div class="statutory-notice">
            <strong>Statutory Disclosure under DPDP Act, 2023:</strong> In accordance with Sections 11 and 12, your request will be acknowledged immediately and resolved within 7 working days. Note: Billing invoices and financial records are subject to statutory retention under Section 36 of the CGST Act, 2017 read with DPDP Act Section 8(7).
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
